{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "game": "hsr",
  "id": "pet-diary-sesame",
  "name": "Pet Diary: Sesame",
  "sortId": 6479,
  "sourceUrl": "https://honkai-star-rail.fandom.com/wiki/Pet_Diary:_Sesame",
  "scrapedAt": "2026-08-26T07:37:21.160Z",
  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(I)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a9aeb48d4f2752e7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I heard you can make more money finding ancient relics than mining, so I asked some of my dad's acquaintances for help."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7de7a48524077972"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "A fortnight later, the only relic I found was something similar to a rand counter — it just looked a bit smaller. I don't know anything about relics, so I had to spare a little cash to hire Balaway from Miner's Lamp for an appraisal."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-159ff147e68859c2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Mr. Balaway said the relic is called a virtual pet. People from the Old World would feed images of their pets into it. Through the device, the pet could live on forever with its owner."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f58ec78bd22c33a2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I didn't know what a pet was, so I asked him. According to the Miner's Lamp, a pet is something of a luxury, something you have to feed and take care of. I had no interest in it whatsoever."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a5fc8f29e8f7748d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Balaway mentioned that the parts inside could be exchanged for some money, but told me not to get my hopes up as Boss Svarog was unlikely to be interested."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a4f83c8cac032683"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "What the heck. I thought this was supposed to make more money than mining."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-94c7359782092b3b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(II)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-68b2ec6906e06b8d"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Thankfully, everything is virtual. I fed it a ton of food and drink."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-97e2dc53792e51dc"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I can barely keep myself alive. It would be impossible for me to have a real pet. Thanks to this \"virtual pet\" thing, I can be a real pet owner."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-5078fa2f1e4c35a8"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dad's friend says that he's looking for a buyer for me. For some reason, I kinda feel like keeping it now. Oh well, I guess I'll just help the next owner take care of it until then... I think today is Sesame's bath day."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-274c07c3afb9b2d6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "By the way, I named it Sesame. Cute, right?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-3ec9adb8e3e1cc10"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(III)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-75032c94b5a8dd19"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Never thought virtual pets would get sick too."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e167bad2d39333e0"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I went and found Natasha to have her look at Sesame. She said that there was nothing she could do and sent me off to look for the Miner's Lamp. I heard that she was a great doctor, how come she couldn't help Sesame?"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1c903d938d3d007f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Don't be scared Sesame, daddy's right here, hang in there."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1746ef39da982a46"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(IV)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-a0c469d21d4b5036"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sesame has recovered!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-8abe3f100dc6cb80"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh man, I was so worried these last two days that I couldn't even eat! I feel so relieved right now! I have to tell everyone, they need to know that Sesame has recovered!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-94f4b5224b54060f"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "It's almost Sesame's birthday, so I'm gonna go get some rock crabs for the celebration! ...Even if it can't really eat anything..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-69d00c5d03da98b2"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(V)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-ef8b0e2ea8789564"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh no! Sesame's been stolen by a bunch of bandits! Those thieves! Those scavengers! Trash!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fbfd54d2c2dad444"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "I recognize their faces, they're thugs from the vagrant camp — they're good at selling relics. They were at the doctor's last time and heard about Sesame."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-fb26611ae85ec056"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Darn! I'm gonna get Sesame back even if it costs me my life!"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-43b70471aedf8d21"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(VI)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-2602f2dd69c36bab"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Sesame! Oh, my sweet Sesame! How could you be sold for scrap..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-1d05f0a9170b3d3c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "When I found them, they said they'd already sold Sesame to Svarogs' vagrants and that it had probably already been salvaged by now."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c20a660715903471"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Oh, Sesame! It'd be pointless for me to fight them now that you're gone... How could this be... I'd be better off dead..."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-73331d77354243af"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "After making a grave for Sesame, maybe... I'm just saying... maybe I should get a Crystal Lizard."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-13a27e4a279c3ab7"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "(VII)"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-34bcf4b246edaa6c"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "This lizard's a pain, I'm done with it."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-902e082a5c831e98"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
